---
id: no-void-query-fn
title: Disallow returning void from query functions
---
NIFT_TANSTACK_DOCUMENT_V1
{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Query functions must return a value that will be cached by TanStack Query. Functions that don't return a value (void functions) can lead to unexpected behavior and might indicate a mistake in the implementation."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"rule-details","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rule Details"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example of "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"incorrect"}]},{"type":"text","value":" code for this rule:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/no-void-query-fn\": \"error\" */\n\nuseQuery({\n  queryKey: ['todos'],\n  queryFn: async () => {\n    await api.todos.fetch() // Function doesn't return the fetched data\n  },\n})","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example of "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"correct"}]},{"type":"text","value":" code for this rule:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/no-void-query-fn\": \"error\" */\nuseQuery({\n  queryKey: ['todos'],\n  queryFn: async () => {\n    const todos = await api.todos.fetch()\n    return todos\n  },\n})","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"attributes","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Attributes"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅ Recommended"}]}],"checked":true},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔧 Fixable"}]}],"checked":false}]}],"headings":[{"id":"rule-details","text":"Rule Details","level":2},{"id":"attributes","text":"Attributes","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nQuery functions must return a value that will be cached by TanStack Query. Functions that don't return a value (void functions) can lead to unexpected behavior and might indicate a mistake in the implementation.\n\n## Rule Details\n\nExample of **incorrect** code for this rule:\n\n```tsx\n/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/no-void-query-fn\": \"error\" */\n\nuseQuery({\n  queryKey: ['todos'],\n  queryFn: async () => {\n    await api.todos.fetch() // Function doesn't return the fetched data\n  },\n})\n```\n\nExample of **correct** code for this rule:\n\n```tsx\n/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/no-void-query-fn\": \"error\" */\nuseQuery({\n  queryKey: ['todos'],\n  queryFn: async () => {\n    const todos = await api.todos.fetch()\n    return todos\n  },\n})\n```\n\n## Attributes\n\n- [x] ✅ Recommended\n- [ ] 🔧 Fixable\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: no-void-query-fn\ntitle: Disallow returning void from query functions\n---\n\nQuery functions must return a value that will be cached by TanStack Query. Functions that don't return a value (void functions) can lead to unexpected behavior and might indicate a mistake in the implementation.\n\n## Rule Details\n\nExample of **incorrect** code for this rule:\n\n```tsx\n/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/no-void-query-fn\": \"error\" */\n\nuseQuery({\n  queryKey: ['todos'],\n  queryFn: async () => {\n    await api.todos.fetch() // Function doesn't return the fetched data\n  },\n})\n```\n\nExample of **correct** code for this rule:\n\n```tsx\n/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/no-void-query-fn\": \"error\" */\nuseQuery({\n  queryKey: ['todos'],\n  queryFn: async () => {\n    const todos = await api.todos.fetch()\n    return todos\n  },\n})\n```\n\n## Attributes\n\n- [x] ✅ Recommended\n- [ ] 🔧 Fixable\n"}
